{title: I Surrender All}
{artist: Judson W. Van DeVenter (1855-1939)}
{key: D}
{copyright: Public Domain}

{sov: Verse 1}
[D]All to Jesus [A]I sur[D]render;
[G]All to Him I [A]freely [D]give;
[D]I will ever [A]love and [Bm]trust Him,
[G]In His presence [A]daily [D]live.
{eov}

{soc}
